Single-database Alembic environment for the Executor PostgreSQL schema.

Revision `0001` is the complete pre-release schema baseline recorded on 2026-08-26. Revision
`0002` is the current head and safely bridges databases created from the earlier deployed `0001`
shape to durable Execution events. The baseline replaces the former incremental development chain.
Databases stamped with a removed pre-baseline development revision must still be recreated.

Create or verify a database with:

    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic current
    uv run alembic check

Service startup never runs Alembic automatically. Run it as a release/init job before starting
Executor processes.
